  <NAME>Identifying differentially expressed genes in Zmat3 knockout cells</NAME>
  <TITLE>Identifying differentially expressed genes in Zmat3 knockout cells</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>The goal of the study was to identify genes whose expression is Zmat3 depedent using RNA-seq. Overall design: We used CRISPR/Cas9 to knockout Zmat3 in Cas9+ E1A;HrasG12V mouse embryonic fibroblasts (MEFs). After selection for Zmat3 or negative control sgRNAs, cells were cultured for 10 days, and then RNA was collected for RNA-seq, using Illumina TruSeq v2.</DESCRIPTION>
